27:["$","p",null,{"children":["The remaining shared options behave as described in\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/stores/s3-and-compatible","children":"the shared options section"}],", with one\ndifference: here ",["$","code",null,{"children":"multipart_max_concurrent_uploads"}]," (default 10) caps how many\nrequests this store has in flight to GCS at once, across all operations, and\nthe chunks of one resumable upload are sent one after another.\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"max_retry_buffer_per_request"}]," is raised to at least the chunk size, and\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"insecure_allow_http"}]," and ",["$","code",null,{"children":"disable_http2"}]," are not consulted by the GCS\nclient."]}]
